        "Craniosynostosis and macrocephaly",
        "GLI3 gene mutations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "aplasia-syndactyly-complex",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Syndactyly and aplasia rather than isolated preaxial brachydactyly",
        "More severe limb malformations",
        "Different genetic etiology"
      ]
    }
  ],
